---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How shahzadakram.com collects, uses, and protects your data."
>
  <section class="wrapper prose page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p>
      This policy explains what data shahzadakram.com ("this site", "I", "me") collects, why, and
      how it's handled. This site is operated by Shahzad Akram, based in the UK.
    </p>

    <h2>Data I collect</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      <strong>Contact form.</strong> When you submit the contact form, I collect the name, email
      address, and message you provide. This is used solely to respond to your enquiry and isn't
      added to any marketing list or shared with third parties.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted">
      <strong>Analytics.</strong> This site uses Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand how
      visitors use the site — pages viewed, general location (country/city level), device type,
      and referral source. This data is aggregated and doesn't identify you personally. Analytics
      only loads after you accept cookies via the banner (see <a href="#cookies">Cookies</a>{' '}
      below).
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted">
      <strong>Spam protection.</strong> The contact form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to verify
      you're not a bot. Turnstile may process your IP address and browser characteristics as part
      of that check. See{' '}
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Cloudflare's Turnstile privacy policy
      </a>{' '}
      for details.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted">
      <strong>Hosting and security.</strong> This site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes
      standard connection data (IP address, browser, request logs) to serve the site and protect
      against abuse. See{' '}
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Cloudflare's privacy policy
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      This site uses a small number of cookies, set only after you accept them via the cookie
      banner:
    </p>
    <ul class="text-muted">
      <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> (Google Analytics) — used to measure site usage anonymously in aggregate.</li>
      <li><strong>Essential cookies</strong> — used by Cloudflare Turnstile to verify form submissions on the contact page. These are necessary for the form to function and aren't optional.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-muted">
      You can withdraw analytics consent at any time by clearing your browser's cookies for this
      site, or by adjusting your choice if the banner is shown again.
    </p>

    <h2>How I use your data</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Contact form submissions are used only to reply to you. Analytics data is used only to
      understand and improve the site. I don't sell your data, and I don't share it with third
      parties beyond the service providers named above (Google, Cloudflare), who process it strictly
      to provide their service.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Contact form emails are kept in my inbox for as long as needed to handle the enquiry and
      any follow-up, then deleted at my discretion. Analytics data is retained according to
      Google Analytics' default retention settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      If you're in the UK or EU, you have rights under UK GDPR / GDPR including the right to
      access, correct, or delete personal data I hold about you, and the right to object to
      processing. To exercise any of these, email{' '}
      <a href="mailto:contact@shahzadakram.com">contact@shahzadakram.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      This policy may be updated occasionally to reflect changes to the site or its data
      practices. The "last updated" date at the top reflects the most recent revision.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Questions about this policy? Email{' '}
      <a href="mailto:contact@shahzadakram.com">contact@shahzadakram.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .page h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .page h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .page ul {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
